<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FlexiPage xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <flexiPageRegions>
        <itemInstances>
            <componentInstance>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>decorate</name>
                    <value>true</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>richTextValue</name>
                    <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(205, 89, 55); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;IMPORTANT NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Please ignore any fields labeled: 1) Recommended Price 2) Eligible Pricing Envelope and 3) Rationale for Pricing. They are located under the section titled &quot;Quote Line Details&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;These features are currently &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;in testing &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;should not be used by anyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;outside of the alpha testing group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;. They will be available once testing is complete.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 56, 56); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Tenders IQR went live for CCG on Tuesday, September 20th! Recordings from the training sessions are available on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://intel.sharepoint.com/sites/MeetComp/SitePages/Tenders-IQR-Training.aspx&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tenders IQR Training SharePoint.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 56, 56); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 56, 56); font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Did you know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 56, 56); font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;… &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;You are now able to access the deal in My Deals by simply clicking on the Deals ID hyperlink in IQR for each quote line! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;The End Customer list in IQR is not populated with accounts from Salesforce and is instead a list of end customers for which the OEM has previously submitted a tender. Reminder: Check the End Customer drop down list before accepting a Write In End Customer entry. If the End Customer already exists, select the drop-down option, and save the change.&amp;nbsp;More information is available by visiting the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/intel-quote-request-home/tenders-iqr-home/tenders-iqr-overview/tenders-iqr-overview-customer-data-governance/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Customer Data Governance&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;section on the IQR Training website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 56, 56); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To help you quickly access the information you need, this homepage can be customized. The intent of the sections below is for you to select list views that contain quote lines you need to process, quote lines you’ve sent to My Deals that received an error, and quote lines that are awaiting division approval in My Deals. To get started, go to the Quote Lines tab and clone or create the list views that you want to select on the home page. View the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/salescrm-functionality/creating-new-views/#lexhowtocreatenewviews&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sales CRM Training&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 56, 56); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;if you need help customizing your list views. After you’ve created your list views, select them from the lists in the sections below. If you have questions, reach out to your Regional Lead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
                <componentName>flexipage:richText</componentName>
                <identifier>flexipage_richText</identifier>
            </componentInstance>
        </itemInstances>
